[{"t":"2026-10-31 02:21:36","title":"\ud83c\udfaf Goal met: 98.8% and 98.4% on two fresh blocks of 1,000 test flights","text":"The M2 snapshot at iteration 8100 (PPO from random weights, 254 M simulated steps in total, ~4.5 h of training) was chosen on 3,000 selection flights (98.5%) and then flown once on each untouched test block in the reference env: block 1 98.8% [97.9-99.3] (8 boulder, 4 timeouts), block 2 98.4% [97.4-99.0] (9 boulder, 4 crashes, 3 timeouts). Both together: 98.6% [98.0-99.0] on 2,000 flights. Zero off-pad landings. Training stopped cleanly (SIGTERM, checkpoint), publish loop and check-ins stopped. Agent and results in models/best/; CONTINUE.md has the details and how to resume. Correction: the M1 journal note said '80 M steps in total'; M1 alone was 80 M, the total at that point was 122 M.","kind":"journal"},{"kind":"goal_check","n":1000,"landed":0.984,"ci":[0.9741677180358003,0.9901278441325737],"score":272.7649890292252,"outcomes":{"landed":984,"boulder":9,"timeout":3,"crashed":4},"timeout":0.003,"offpad":0.0,"boulder":0.009,"crashed":0.004,"touch_speed":0.2610012888908386,"steps":228.285,"t":"2026-10-31 02:20:45","policy":"models/best/M2_i08100.json","start":2000010000,"block":2,"label":"M2 snapshot 8100 (PPO from scratch, 254 M steps in total) \u00b7 test block 2","note":"Confirmation on the second, fresh block of test seeds. Reference gymnasium env, real task, no help.","replay":"replays/goal_goal_M2_i08100_b2.gif"},{"kind":"goal_check","n":1000,"landed":0.988,"ci":[0.9791425260718425,0.9931224209078404],"score":274.0523106340378,"outcomes":{"landed":988,"timeout":4,"boulder":8},"timeout":0.004,"offpad":0.0,"boulder":0.008,"crashed":0.0,"touch_speed":0.25869449973106384,"steps":232.72,"t":"2026-10-31 02:20:21","policy":"models/best/M2_i08100.json","start":2000000000,"block":1,"label":"M2 snapshot 8100 (PPO from scratch, 254 M steps in total) \u00b7 test block 1","note":"Chosen on 3,000 selection flights (98.5%). Reference gymnasium env, real task, no help.","replay":"replays/goal_goal_M2_i08100_b1.gif"},{"t":"2026-10-31 00:33:07","kind":"goal_best","it":1060,"steps":17383424,"stage_index":0,"stage":"hard cases, fine-tune, no early stop","check":{"n":200,"landed":1.0,"offpad":0.0,"timeout":0.0,"boulder":0.0,"crashed":0.0,"score":273.3090208140365},"champion":"runs/M2/champions/i01060_s0_goal.json","run":"M2","replay":"replays/M2_0005.gif"},{"t":"2026-10-31 00:16:24","kind":"goal_best","it":80,"steps":1327104,"stage_index":0,"stage":"hard cases, fine-tune, no early stop","check":{"n":200,"landed":0.995,"offpad":0.0,"timeout":0.0,"boulder":0.005,"crashed":0.0,"score":274.2817467992139},"champion":"runs/M2/champions/i00080_s0_goal.json","run":"M2","replay":"replays/M2_0004.gif"},{"t":"2026-10-31 00:16:15","kind":"goal_best","it":70,"steps":1163264,"stage_index":0,"stage":"hard cases, fine-tune, no early stop","check":{"n":200,"landed":0.985,"offpad":0.0,"timeout":0.005,"boulder":0.005,"crashed":0.005,"score":271.7896202592436},"champion":"runs/M2/champions/i00070_s0_goal.json","run":"M2","replay":"replays/M2_0003.gif"},{"t":"2026-10-31 00:16:01","title":"Hard cases work: 96.6% on 1,000 fresh flights","text":"Main run M1 finished its curriculum at 23:05 (80 M steps in total).\nStage 2, hard cases (30% of flights re-fly seeds failed on recent checks): the check average rose from 92.7% (stage 1 plateau) to ~96.3% within ~40 M steps, and boulder hits fell from ~5% to ~2.3%. The stage passed 98.5% on 200 + 200 fresh flights at iteration 4540, after 24 earlier check passes had failed their confirmation. Stage 3, fine-tune (lr 1e-4) passed 99.0% / 98.5% just 320 iterations later.\nHonest measurement on 1,000 fresh selection flights (seeds 1,500,500,000+): the hard-case champion 94.7% [93.1-95.9]; the fine-tune champion 96.6% [95.3-97.6] (boulder 1.7%, timeout 1.1%, crash 0.5%, off-pad 0.1%). Best agent so far, but its 98.5% pass was luck: passing 200+200 checks by chance after many tries is the winner's curse again.\nMistake in the design: a passed final stage ends the run. The CPU sat idle from 23:05 to 00:14. Change for M2: one long stage that never ends by itself (hard cases + fine-tune settings), a snapshot every 100 iterations, and champions picked on 1,000 selection flights afterwards.","kind":"journal"},{"t":"2026-10-31 00:15:17","kind":"goal_best","it":0,"steps":16384,"stage_index":0,"stage":"hard cases, fine-tune, no early stop","check":{"n":200,"landed":0.98,"offpad":0.005,"timeout":0.005,"boulder":0.01,"crashed":0.0,"score":273.16394073028675},"champion":"runs/M2/champions/i00000_s0_goal.json","run":"M2","replay":"replays/M2_0002.gif"},{"t":"2026-10-31 00:15:15","kind":"run_start","it":0,"steps":0,"stage_index":0,"note":"Main run 2 continues M1 (96.6% [95.3-97.6] on 1,000 fresh selection flights after 80 M steps). M1's curriculum ended too early: its 200+200-flight pass checks were passed by luck after many tries. M2 has one long stage that never ends by itself: hard cases (30% of flights re-fly real-task seeds failed on recent checks) with the fine-tune settings (learning rate 1e-4, entropy bonus 0.003). A snapshot every 100 iterations; champions are chosen afterwards on 1,000 selection flights, never on the checks.","run":"M2"},{"t":"2026-10-31 00:15:15","kind":"stage_start","it":0,"steps":0,"stage_index":0,"stage":"hard cases, fine-tune, no early stop","expect":"Hard cases took the checks from 92.7% to ~96.3% in 40 M steps. Expect a slower climb toward 97.5-98% over the night; remaining failures: boulder 1.7%, timeout 1.1%, crash 0.5%.","run":"M2"},{"t":"2026-10-30 23:05:19","kind":"check_pass","it":4860,"steps":79642624,"stage_index":2,"stage":"fine-tune","check":{"n":200,"landed":0.99,"offpad":0.005,"timeout":0.0,"boulder":0.005,"crashed":0.0,"score":271.87463032679204},"confirm":{"n":200,"landed":0.985,"offpad":0.0,"timeout":0.0,"boulder":0.005,"crashed":0.01,"score":269.2845670911583},"run":"M1"},{"t":"2026-10-30 23:05:19","kind":"stage_pass","it":4860,"